  IDENTICAL across all three candidates and the Engishiki item itself -- Q1047144 + Q7402764 on
  Q135069920, Q135069921, Q135270265 and Q135040248 alike. Wikidata access would not have decided
  it; do not retry that route. Nothing else separates the two Kasuga items either: same P31 set,
  same P17, no coordinates on either, and NO jawiki sitelink on any candidate, so the usual
  per-candidate jawiki/Kokugakuin research path does not exist for them. The only asymmetries are
  cosmetic (Q135069921's en label is "Kasuga- Shrine", a typo) and one candidate, Q135270265,
  already carries the Engishiki name 保曽呂伎神社 and has coordinates. A name match plus one
